# nr and ni

- **`ni`** - Install dependencies (auto-detects package manager)
- **`nr`** - Run scripts from package.json (auto-detects package manager)

## ❌ Do NOT use

- `npm install` / `npm run`
- `yarn add` / `yarn run`
- `pnpm install` / `pnpm run`

Always use `ni` and `nr` instead.

## ✅ Common Commands

```bash
nr dev          # pnpm dev
nr build        # pnpm build
nr test         # pnpm test
nr lint         # pnpm lint

ni package      # pnpm i package
ni -D @types/node  # pnpm i -D @types/node
```

Works with: npm, yarn, pnpm, bun, deno

See: [ni GitHub](https://github.com/antfu-collective/ni)

